{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Vesperis is a first-person psychological horror game, filled with puzzles.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Gameplay:</strong> The game focuses on exploring environments and solving puzzles to advance the narrative.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a mysterious event, your grandmother was taken by supernatural forces and passed away. As you investigate what happened, you will face unknown horrors and unearth secrets that challenge reality, threatening your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, supernatural forces emerge to challenge your limits. Explore every room in your grandmother\u2019s enormous house, discover hidden passages, and confront horrors that hide in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655670/extras/Gif_MulherCruz__520x300.gif?t=1746116046\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655670?t=1746116046","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655670?t=1746116046","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655670/965e2a1116d3267e954fecb5600d4a42b2eeefc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746116046","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655670/965e2a1116d3267e954fecb5600d4a42b2eeefc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746116046","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains atmospheric and disturbing scenes of psychological and physical violence, including sudden scares and supernatural threats."},"demos":[{"appid":3692850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Vesperis is a first-person psychological horror game, filled with puzzles.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Gameplay:</strong> The game focuses on exploring environments and solving puzzles to advance the narrative.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a mysterious event, your grandmother was taken by supernatural forces and passed away. As you investigate what happened, you will face unknown horrors and unearth secrets that challenge reality, threatening your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, supernatural forces emerge to challenge your limits. Explore every room in your grandmother\u2019s enormous house, discover hidden passages, and confront horrors that hide in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655670/extras/Gif_MulherCruz__520x300.gif?t=1746116046\" /></p>","developers":["AbnerDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655670/dfe491baeba1c7d4205442323fb0f694b06c2fda/header.jpg?t=1746116046","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129375,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129375/movie480.mp4?t=1745634933","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail